LAMMPS (7 Aug 2019)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# 3D Silicon crack simulation using Stillinger-Weber



variable name string tstp



dimension  	3
boundary 	s s p
units 		metal
atom_style 	atomic
neighbor 	0.3 bin
neigh_modify 	delay 5


# create geometry

lattice  diamond 5.43
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5.43 5.43 5.43
region  box block 0 400 0 1000 0 1 units lattice
create_box 9 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (2172 5430 5.43)
  5 by 16 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 3202801 atoms
  create_atoms CPU = 0.124233 secs

#masses of different atom sections
mass  1 28.06
mass  2 28.06
mass  3 28.06
mass  4 28.06
mass  5 28.06
mass  6 28.06
mass  7 28.06
mass  8 28.06
mass  9 28.06


# potential setup
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * Si.sw Si Si Si Si Si Si Si Si Si



# define groups

#fix  1 all nvt temp 1 1 0.1
fix  1 all nve
run 0
Neighbor list info ...
  update every 1 steps, delay 5 steps, check yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
